#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_House2/scripts.inc:21
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_House2_Text_DidYouKnowAboutMtPyreOrbs"
msgid ""
"MT. PYRE…\p"
"At its peak are two orbs placed side\n"
"by side. Did you know?$"
msgstr ""
"送神山……\p"
"在它的山顶上，\n"
"并排放着两颗宝珠。你知道吗？$"

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_House2/scripts.inc:26
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_House2_Text_YesTwoOrbsSideBySide"
msgid ""
"Yes, two orbs side by side…\p"
"The sight of them together…\n"
"It is somehow soothing…$"
msgstr ""
"是的，两颗并排的宝珠……\p"
"看着它们在一起……\n"
"不知为何就让人感到安心……$"

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_House2/scripts.inc:31
